+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-4" id="question-4">
+          <span>Why do cats stare out the window?</span>
+          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-4" hidden>
+          <p>Windows offer moving light, birds, insects, and neighborhood activity. For many cats, it is a safe way to satisfy curiosity and provide mental stimulation.</p>
+        </div>
+      </div>
+
+      <div class="example">
+        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-5" id="question-5">
+          <span>How can I tell if a cat is happy?</span>
+          <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
+        </button>
+        <div class="details" id="answer-5" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-5" hidden>
